1
00:00:00,306 --> 00:00:01,636
(Leonard:)So, are we doing this?

2
00:00:01,641 --> 00:00:03,671
Okay, but where
does he get the helium?

3
00:00:03,676 --> 00:00:05,406
(Leonard:)Remember?
Don't ask too many questions?

4
00:00:05,411 --> 00:00:07,911
(Sheldon:)Uh, but this is
violating university code.

5
00:00:07,914 --> 00:00:09,744
(Leonard:)A little, but...
(stammers)

6
00:00:09,749 --> 00:00:11,349
(Leonard:)if I may quote Einstein,

7
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:13,480
“The pursuit of science calls us

8
00:00:13,486 --> 00:00:16,286
to ignore the rules set by man”"

9
00:00:16,289 --> 00:00:18,119
(Sheldon:)Huh.

10
00:00:18,124 --> 00:00:19,394
(Sheldon:)All right, do it.

11
00:00:19,392 --> 00:00:20,762
(Leonard:)Tell him we're in.

12
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:22,430
(Leonard typing rapidly)

13
00:00:22,428 --> 00:00:24,698
(Leonard:)Done.

14
00:00:24,697 --> 00:00:26,697
(Sheldon:)I can't find that quote
on the Internet.

15
00:00:26,699 --> 00:00:28,829
(Sheldon:)Did you make that up?

16
00:00:31,203 --> 00:00:32,603
(Leonard:)Before I answer,

17
00:00:32,605 --> 00:00:35,775
(Leonard:)may I just say your skin
has never looked better.

18
00:00:38,311 --> 00:00:40,711
(Sheldon:)Aren't you just made of sugar.

19
00:00:43,316 --> 00:00:45,586
(Amy:)I'm not sure
how I feel about this.

20
00:00:45,585 --> 00:00:47,115
(Penny:)Oh, come on, just let him
put the app on your phone.

21
00:00:47,119 --> 00:00:48,919
(Bernadette:)Yeah, Stuart got
two dates with it.

22
00:00:48,921 --> 00:00:52,721
(Stuart:)One of which would've ended
in sex had she not said no.

23
00:00:53,993 --> 00:00:55,763
(Stuart:)Okay, all set.

24
00:00:55,761 --> 00:00:57,191
(Penny:)Okay, let me see.
(clears her throat)

25
00:00:57,196 --> 00:00:58,966
(Penny:)Nope, nope,

